\newlabel{fig:bhdforligochapterdetectorrepsonse}{{1.2}{12}{The linear response function between strain and light power at the AS port was obtained from a \textsc {Finesse} simulation of the LLO detector\cite {l1_finesse_2014}. The corner frequency at $\approx 300$\,Hz comes from the pole of the coupled SRC-arm cavity. The behaviour below $6$\,Hz is due to optical spring effects.\relax }{figure.caption.12}{}}
